# Automation Google Excel Rules

- For data cleanup, prefer dry-run mode before writing changes.
- Log input count, transformed count, skipped rows, validation errors, and output path.
- For Google APIs, isolate auth/client setup from business logic.
- Never commit Google credentials or service account keys.
- Excel exports should have stable columns, clear headers, date formats, totals where useful, and internal notes when data is incomplete.
- Automation scripts must be idempotent when possible.
- For reports, separate data extraction, transformation, and rendering/export.
